        },
        {
          "text": "Mundu naga akukulupuka ku yakusakala ya cilambo capasi pano pakum'manyilila Yesu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Klistu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Ambuje ni Mkulupusyo jwetu, panyuma pakwe ni kusimanikwa kuti akutendaga yakusakala ni kugomecedwa ni yakusakalayo, ni kuti pambesi pakwe taciŵa ŵakusakala mnope kupunda muŵaŵelele pandanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yikaliji yambone yikaŵe kuti jemanjajo ngakulimanyilila litala lya cilungamo, kulekangana ni kulileka ali amanyilile lilamusi lyeswela liŵapelece Mlungu kwa jemanjajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
